            <ArticleTitle>[Epidemiology and human rights: Zika virus outlook and reproductive rights in Latin America].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>748-756</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>With this article we review the current Zika virus (ZIKV) epidemic. We also look back over the last scientific evidence relating ZIKV to microcephaly and Guillain-Barré syndrome. Finally, we also address the challenges in terms of reproductive rights in Latin America.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
